{"entries":[[8271,"cohue","noun",3,"/kɔ.y/","f","",[["crowd, rabble","",[],[],[["Emma était accoudée à sa fenêtre (elle s'y mettait souvent: la fenêtre, en province, remplace les théâtres et la promenade), et elle s'amusait à considérer la cohue des rustres, lorsqu'elle aperçut un monsieur vêtu d'une redingote de velours vert.","",""],["Malgré la cohue, le chemin était toujours libre devant nous. Quand il fallait traverser une rue, un agent, comme par hasard, interrompait la circulation.","Despite the crowd, the road was always open before us. Whenever we had to cross a street, some force, as if by chance, stopped traffic.",""]]]],{"plural":"cohues"},[],""],[9594,"cohérent","adjective",3,"/kɔ.e.ʁɑ̃/","",[8025,"Fr-coh%C3%A9rent.ogg.mp3"],[["coherent","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"cohérent","feminine":"cohérente","masculine_plural":"cohérents","feminine_plural":"cohérentes"},[],["Les grains du grès sont très cohérents.","Les molécules du fer sont plus cohérentes que celles du plomb."]],[10805,"cohorte","noun",3,"/kɔ.ɔʁt/","f",[8982,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-cohorte.wav.mp3"],[["cohort","",[],[],[]],["cohort, a division of the Roman legion","",[],[],[]],["age group, age bracket","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"cohortes"},["étude de cohorte"],["Les saintes cohortes.","De vaillantes cohortes.","Il rallia ses cohortes."]],[11077,"cohésion","noun",3,"/kɔ.e.zjɔ̃/","f",[9195,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-coh%C3%A9sion.wav.mp3"],[["cohesion (the state of cohering, or of sticking together)","",[],[],[]],["cohesion","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"cohésions"},[],["La cohésion est plus forte dans les corps solides que dans les corps liquides.","La compréhension des liens entre la cohésion territoriale et la cohésion sociale est un défi majeur pour les politiques publiques."]],[12541,"cohérence","noun",2,"/kɔ.e.ʁɑ̃s/","f",[10275,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-coh%C3%A9rence.wav.mp3"],[["coherence, consistence, consistency","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"cohérences"},[],["La cohérence d'une théorie ne garantit pas qu'elle décrit son objet correctement.","Une telle synthétisation de la théorie implique un haut degré d'unité des explications fournies, de la cohérence philosophique, conceptuelle et méthodologique."]],[15901,"cohabiter","verb",2,"/kɔ.a.bi.te/","",[12795,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-cohabiter.wav.mp3"],[["to cohabit, to live together","",[],[],[]]],{"infinitive":"cohabiter","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"cohabitant","past_participle":"cohabité","present":["cohabite","cohabites","cohabite","cohabitons","cohabitez","cohabitent"],"imperfect":["cohabitais","cohabitais","cohabitait","cohabitions","cohabitiez","cohabitaient"],"future":["cohabiterai","cohabiteras","cohabitera","cohabiterons","cohabiterez","cohabiteront"],"conditional":["cohabiterais","cohabiterais","cohabiterait","cohabiterions","cohabiteriez","cohabiteraient"],"subjunctive":["cohabite","cohabites","cohabite","cohabitions","cohabitiez","cohabitent"]},[],""],[19795,"cohabitation","noun",2,"/kɔ.a.bi.ta.sjɔ̃/","f",[15863,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-cohabitation.wav.mp3"],[["cohabitation (act of living together)","",[],[],[]],["cohabitation","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"cohabitations"},[],["Une cohabitation ou un mariage se profilent.","La cohabitation avec les Musulmans a modifié l'attitude des Francs de Syrie.","Cette cohabitation paradoxale de la liberté et de la faute pose les plus difficiles problèmes."]],[29590,"cohéritier","noun",1,"/kɔ.e.ʁi.tje/","m",[23947,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-coh%C3%A9ritier.wav.mp3"],[["coinheritor","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"cohéritiers","feminine":"cohéritière"},[],["Elles sont cohéritières.","Partage entre cohéritiers.","Sans doute, par le rapport des dettes, le cohéritier débiteur se libère envers ses cohéritiers comme s'il faisait un paiement."]],[36640,"cohabitant","noun",1,"/kɔ.a.bi.tɑ̃/","m",[29445,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-cohabitant.wav.mp3"],[["cohabitant","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"cohabitants","feminine":"cohabitante"},[],["Mais la difficulté était ailleurs : comment inviter ce cohabitant impossible ?"]],[49238,"cohobat","noun",0,"/kɔ.ɔ.ba/","m",[36583,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-cohobat.wav.mp3"],[["cohobate, cohobation (concentrated distillate)","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"cohobats"},[],["Le cohobat de fleur d'oranger est une version concentrée d'une eau florale de fleur d'oranger.","Cette technique d'obtention d'un cohobat permet de recueillir des concentrés d'un rapport supérieur de 30 à 50 fois aux eaux aromatiques."]],[49239,"cohobation","noun",0,"/kɔ.ɔ.ba.sjɔ̃/","f",[36584,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-cohobation.wav.mp3"],[["cohobation","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"cohobations"},[],["Pour la rose on retire seulement 25% d'huile essentielle en distillation directe et 75% supplémentaire par cohobation.","On modifie l'importance des pertes en éléments solubles, mais aisément entraînables, au moyen de la cohobation continue des eaux."]],[49240,"cohober","verb",0,"/kɔ.ɔ.be/","",[36585,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-cohober.wav.mp3"],[["to cohobate","",[],[],[]]],{"infinitive":"cohober","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"cohobant","past_participle":"cohobé","present":["cohobe","cohobes","cohobe","cohobons","cohobez","cohobent"],"imperfect":["cohobais","cohobais","cohobait","cohobions","cohobiez","cohobaient"],"future":["cohoberai","cohoberas","cohobera","cohoberons","cohoberez","cohoberont"],"conditional":["cohoberais","cohoberais","cohoberait","cohoberions","cohoberiez","cohoberaient"],"subjunctive":["cohobe","cohobes","cohobe","cohobions","cohobiez","cohobent"]},[],["Ne se rencontre-t-il pas des hommes qui, par une décharge de leur volition, cohobent les sentiments des masses ?"]],[49241,"cohortage","noun",0,"","f","",[["cohort","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"cohortages"},[],""],[49242,"cohéremment","adverb",0,"/kɔ.e.ʁa.mɑ̃/","",[36586,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-coh%C3%A9remment.wav.mp3"],[["coherently","",[],[],[["Je n'arrive pas à parler cohéremment.","I'm not able to talk coherently.",""]]]],{},[]